## **Learnings**
✅ **Optimized Frequency Counting Using Hash Maps**  
Using `dict.get()` simplifies updates without explicit checks.  

✅ **Handling Edge Cases with `inf`**  
Using `float('inf')` ensures clean min/max calculations without arbitrary values.  

✅ **Efficient Computation in Linear Time**  
Maintaining separate min/max values avoids unnecessary loops, keeping the algorithm **O(n)**.

